{"id":"3225aa77bce6f46a","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-closed-winning-strategies.md","title":"后手全部胜策的有效闭类","display":"df-closed-winning-strategies — 后手全部胜策的有效闭类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-closed-winning-strategies","aliases":["20-df-closed-winning-strategies"],"display":"df-closed-winning-strategies — 后手全部胜策的有效闭类","chapter":"15","section":"15.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Exercise 15.1.2(iii) 的策略编码展开","source_printed_pages":[218],"source_pdf_pages":[247],"depends_on":["[[20-df-gale-stewart]]","[[20-df-closed-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-closed-winning-strategies"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-closed-winning-strategies</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-closed-winning-strategies — 后手全部胜策的有效闭类"},{"key":"chapter","html":"15"},{"key":"section","html":"15.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 15.1.2(iii) 的策略编码展开"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>218</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>247</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" href=\"?note=f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" title=\"20-df-gale-stewart\">20-df-gale-stewart</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为 c.e. 串集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho]\">\\(A=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho]\\)</span>。固定奇数长度串的可计算双射枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\omega\\to H_{II}\">\\(q:\\omega\\to H_{II}\\)</span>。实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in2^\\omega\">\\(g\\in2^\\omega\\)</span> 编码全策略 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_g(q(j))=g(j)\">\\(s_g(q(j))=g(j)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" href=\"?note=f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" title=\"20-df-gale-stewart\">20-df-gale-stewart</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed-winning-strategies}\\vdash\n\\mathcal W_{II}(S):=\\{g\\in2^\\omega:\\forall\\rho\\in S\\ \\exists n\\in\\{j&lt;|\\rho|:j\\equiv1\\pmod2\\}\\ [g(q^{-1}(\\rho\\upharpoonright n))\\ne\\rho(n)]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed-winning-strategies}\\vdash\n\\mathcal W_{II}(S):=\\{g\\in2^\\omega:\\forall\\rho\\in S\\ \\exists n\\in\\{j&lt;|\\rho|:j\\equiv1\\pmod2\\}\\ [g(q^{-1}(\\rho\\upharpoonright n))\\ne\\rho(n)]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>此集合是有效闭类，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathcal W_{II}(S)\">\\(g\\in\\mathcal W_{II}(S)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Win}_{II}(s_g,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Win}_{II}(s_g,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一个失败见证是某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in S\">\\(\\rho\\in S\\)</span> 与策略在所有已有 II 回合上相容；它只查询有限多个策略坐标，构成有限个策略柱的并，能从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的枚举有效列出。所有失败柱的并有效开，其补即所定义的类。若有相容 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span>，它能延伸为遵循全策略的对局，且已进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>；反向任何失败对局已有一个这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 前缀。因此量化的是全部对手选择下的全策略，不是仅存在一条成功 play。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 218 / PDF 247。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-gale-stewart","status":"resolved","id":"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-gale-stewart]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-gale-stewart","status":"resolved","id":"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho]","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\omega\\to H_{II}","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s_g(q(j))=g(j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed-winning-strategies}\\vdash\n\\mathcal W_{II}(S):=\\{g\\in2^\\omega:\\forall\\rho\\in S\\ \\exists n\\in\\{j<|\\rho|:j\\equiv1\\pmod2\\}\\ [g(q^{-1}(\\rho\\upharpoonright n))\\ne\\rho(n)]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathcal W_{II}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Win}_{II}(s_g,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1757,"backlinks":[{"id":"8372f8b6f584a62e","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-lem-open-winning-certificate]]；see [[20-df-closed-winning-strategies]]；see [[20-thm-low-basis]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]。"}],"outgoing":["f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","b73290a0af01d44f"]}